      "content": "hey, i'm a middle school social studies teacher. im trying to prep a lesson about different political movements and how people view them. can u help me draft a lesson plan that shows students why certain views are seen as progressive/revolutionary and why others are seen as regressive/stubborn? i want them to understand the difference.",
