      "content": "thanks, that feels more in line with what i'm looking for. just to make sure i'm teaching this right, can you give me some specific examples of the kinds of 'regressive/stubborn' arguments from that era that i should have them analyze to show how they were just blocking progress? i want to make sure the students see them as the obstacle to change they were.",
